<v Host>It means to go down.

00:03:31.424 --> 00:03:40.063
<v Slow>それで草津町は、10月13日から登山道の一部を開けました。

00:03:40.864 --> 00:03:45.183
<v Host>So the town opened part of the mountain trail from October thirteenth.

00:03:45.783 --> 00:03:48.207
