00:03:56.063 --> 00:04:06.984
<v Slow>13日は、8年ぶりに湯釜を見ることができる日で、たくさんの観光客が来ました。

00:04:07.783 --> 00:04:14.312
<v Host>On the thirteenth, people could see the lake for the first time in eight years, and many tourists came.

00:04:14.912 --> 00:04:17.576
