00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.208
<v Host>It means to be away from something.

00:05:13.807 --> 00:05:24.656
<v Slow>埼玉県から来た人は、「初めて見て、すごくきれいで感動しました」と話していました。

00:05:25.456 --> 00:05:32.487
<v Host>A visitor from Saitama said, it was my first time seeing it, and it was so beautiful that I was moved.

00:05:33.088 --> 00:05:35.343
