00:05:35.744 --> 00:05:38.576
<v Host>It means being deeply moved by something.

00:05:39.175 --> 00:05:49.519
<v Slow>湯釜を見学できるのは、午前10時から午後3時までで、11月8日までです。

00:05:50.319 --> 00:05:55.624
<v Host>Visits are allowed from ten in the morning to three in the afternoon, until November eighth.

00:05:56.223 --> 00:05:58.504
